{"id":16192,"brand_id":228,"unique_id":"G-2As3A4gjvCgXB9","content_key":"/p/stories/exchangeforchange","identifies_id":228,"identifies_type":"Brand","title":"Exchange for Change","data":{"blocks":[{"col_1":[{"url":"https://imagecdn.mightycause.com/75a1f87d-e904-4625-a3a9-9909b34e14aa/","type":"image","uuid":"75a1f87d-e904-4625-a3a9-9909b34e14aa","scale":"scale-100","width":1600,"height":900,"content":"tempImagey36XD8.heic","new_tab":true,"alt_text":null,"link_url":"https://www.instagram.com/p/DBRh7lfugIq/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link\u0026igsh=MzRlODBiNWFlZA==","position":"center"},{"type":"text","content":"\u003ch1 id=\"isPasted\"\u003eExchange for Change\u003c/h1\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026ldquo;Without money from Give Miami Day, we would suffer greatly,\u0026rdquo; says Kathie Klarreich, Executive Director of Exchange for Change. \u0026ldquo;It keeps us alive.\u0026rdquo;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eExchange for Change delivers a variety of college-level writing courses to the incarcerated population at five correctional institutions across South Florida, plus a sixth in Central Florida. The nonprofit has reached 1,925 students.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDollars raised on Give Miami Day help pay the salaries of their two-member staff, a team that the nonprofit is eager to expand. \u0026ldquo;We would be able to expand the program exponentially if we hire more staff because we\u0026rsquo;re so lean,\u0026rdquo; said Klarreich.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eKlarreich says Exchange for Change\u0026rsquo;s value isn\u0026rsquo;t reflected in its budget; supplies for a class of 15 students cost just about $15.00. Exchange for Change believes that small investment pays out major dividends to Greater Miami, affording a quality education and relevant skills to a group of individuals who will ultimately rejoin our community.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe organization\u0026rsquo;s potential for exponential growth also exists because of the context; Florida is home to the third largest incarcerated population in the United States. Through Give Miami Day fundraising, Exchange for Change hopes to hire the staff that\u0026rsquo;ll make it possible to reach the rest of the Miami-based prison population \u0026ndash; and beyond.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DBRh7lfugIq/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link\u0026igsh=MzRlODBiNWFlZA==\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eMore on Instagram\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.givemiamiday.org/p/stories\"\u003eBack to Give Miami Day Stories.\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"}],"layout":"block_2","col_order":["col_1"],"spacer_top":{"max":128,"min":0,"val":64},"backgrounds":[{"url":"https://imagecdn.mightycause.com/ae3634ab-2efc-4c04-a5ef-a2bd54dfd616/","uuid":"ae3634ab-2efc-4c04-a5ef-a2bd54dfd616"}],"spacer_bottom":{"max":128,"min":0,"val":64},"spacer_mobile":true,"background_type":"image","background_color":null,"background_solid":null,"background_opacity":0}],"header":{"config":{"hide":false,"gradient":false,"textStyle":"dark"}}},"version":2,"published_at":"2024-10-29T17:01:51.000-04:00","deleted_at":null,"redirect_type":null,"redirect_url":null,"updated_at":"2024-10-29T17:01:51.000-04:00","created_at":"2024-10-29T17:01:51.000-04:00","internal_ref_title":"Exchange for Change","milestone_id":null,"giving_event_id":null,"is_fallback":false,"metadata_computed":{"description":"","og_title":"Exchange for Change","og_description":null,"og_image_url":"https://imagecdn.mightycause.com/38461e70-27b8-4d4b-b5b6-93a81c2353df/-/crop/400x209/0,91/-/preview/","og_image_uuid":"38461e70-27b8-4d4b-b5b6-93a81c2353df","og_image_width":400,"og_image_height":209,"relative_url":"/p/stories/exchangeforchange","seo_no_index":null,"schema_markup":null},"metadata_stored":null,"min_mc_created_at":null,"user_may_edit_content":false,"draft_present":false,"created_by":{"id":"lsri8f","name":"Nathan Moyer"},"updat